From 1eedff668d98d704bdad8965e60095cc643e5beb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: xxxvik-xakerxxx <19531907+xxxvik-xakerxxx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 21:00:22 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] clk: mediatek: add MT6878 MMSYS gates

Port the 35 MMSYS display gates from Nothing OS 4.1 commit
ee2be53cb75670b548948636a0db1d1ff112bf12 using the mainline MediaTek
clock-provider pattern. Register the provider as the child created by
mtk-mmsys, so the clock and routing drivers share the 0x14000000 syscon.

This adds no DT node and therefore changes no default runtime behavior.

Signed-off-by: xxxvik-xakerxxx <19531907+xxxvik-xakerxxx@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../bindings/arm/mediatek/mediatek,mmsys.yaml |  1 +
 drivers/clk/mediatek/Makefile                 |  2 +-
 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt6878-mmsys.c       | 96 +++++++++++++++++++
 drivers/soc/mediatek/mtk-mmsys.c              |  5 +
 4 files changed, 103 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/clk/mediatek/clk-mt6878-mmsys.c

